# OffsetEase — SEO redirects
# Consolidate .html duplicate URLs to their extensionless canonical form.
# 301 permanent, server-side. The trailing "!" forces the redirect even though
# the source file exists (needed so /slug is still served from slug.html while
# /slug.html itself redirects). Works on Netlify and Cloudflare Pages.

# Homepage
/index.html                      /                           301!

# The 11 audited duplicate pairs (explicit for clarity/verification)
/esg-reporting.html              /esg-reporting              301!
/resources.html                  /resources                  301!
/life-cycle-assessment.html      /life-cycle-assessment      301!
/ghg-accounting.html             /ghg-accounting             301!
/epd.html                        /epd                        301!
/product-carbon-footprint.html   /product-carbon-footprint   301!
/ecovadis.html                   /ecovadis                   301!
/cbam.html                       /cbam                       301!
/cdp.html                        /cdp                        301!
/climate-risk.html               /climate-risk               301!
/privacy.html                    /privacy                    301!

# Catch-all: every other .html URL on the site has the same duplicate problem.
# This future-proofs any .html path added later.
/*.html                          /:splat                     301!
